WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Pineapple, Zinger, February

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.410
Episode 1

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.900
Even the most vicious dog

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.790
will not bite the hand that feeds him.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.160
He will wag his tail.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:33.370
When I started cooking at 13,

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:36.270
I dreamed of working in the Blue House.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:39.570
I wanted to become the one who feeds the most influential person.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:42.070
That's how I became a chef.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.180
You mentioned earlier that you became

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.350
the youngest chef at the Blue House.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.080
-I became the first.
-What?

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.650
Here you go.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.060
Cod.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.960
Will do.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.940
The ambassador does not tolerate bones in fish.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.340
Be careful.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.270
Well, give it to me.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.820
If you repeat this again,

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.810
I will give him only the head of the fish.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.620
The chef cooks the fish himself

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.100
don't worry.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.120
Is he Emperor Qin Shihuang or something?

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.590
Qin Shihuang?

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.490
Fish cake was invented for Qin Shihuang.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.940
Emperor Qin Shihuang was so domineering,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.010
that when he ate his favorite fish every day

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.640
and he came across a bone,

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.170
he cut off the head of the one who prepared it.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:48.750
Every day the cooks died

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.510
and one day the new boss thought,

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.120
that death awaits him too.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.590
In despair, he mechanically

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:58.950
cut fish on a cutting board.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:00.980
Eureka.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:04.220
He was very lucky.

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.560
It may surprise you that one person kills another over food,

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.530
but it's not just food.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:15.700
A properly prepared dish will melt the hardest heart.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:20.400
This is the most adorable weapon in the world.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.180
That's exactly what I think when I cook at the Blue House.

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:29.550
"Cooking is politics."

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.960
Since we're on this topic, please answer the questions:

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:35.390
which everyone is interested in.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.850
For example, what are the secrets in the Blue House?

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.060
First of all, I want to clarify something.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.230
My name will not be revealed

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.160
and pay in cash. Fine?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.350
Camera? There was a short circuit due to a leak,

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.670
doesn't work all week.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.550
Did it break on its own, or did someone break it?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.720
There are times when you have to turn a blind eye to this.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.650
Thanks to this, I was lucky too.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.470
Is it normal that we are here?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.070
After the main course is served, the game is over.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:20.100
Right now the Chinese ambassador is getting a taste of heaven.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:48.860
Chef Chan! Find him!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.790
Chef Chan!

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.800
-Where are you?
-Breakers.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.430
It's exhausting to be so cool.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.480
The ambassador liked my food so much,

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.610
What does he personally want to thank?

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.850
I'll be back soon, Sunyeon.

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.310
My name is Hyejeong.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.080
Sunyeon suits you better.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:24.160
Episode 1: Jang Bong Hwan in Wonderland

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.330
Angry dog. It might bite.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.610
God.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.710
Tek, come on.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.030
Chan Bong Hwan.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.820
Jongno Police.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:56.100
Chief Chan, his last name is Chan,

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.070
he calls himself the best cook in the area,

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.200
I feel like I'm losing because of my name.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.980
When we start promoting Korean food,

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:06.670
the whole world will know the name Pu Seungmin.

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.310
Not Chan Bong Hwan.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.480
Try better and don't talk.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.610
Fine.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.280
We won't be blamed for this.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.150
We are clean.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.810
Angry dog. It might bite.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:28.170
Well damn. They scared us.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.000
Come with us to the station.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.370
It was decided

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.370
that the hook got stuck there while fishing,

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.010
and I was fired.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.040
What else?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.130
There is evidence of bribes during food delivery.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.540
What bribes?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.520
Quite significant over two years.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.310
Does the evidence point to me?

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:47.720
Where did you get the idea?

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.560
We need your testimony.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.550
You don't know how to pretend at all.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.380
Open the door.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.700
I'm sure you, like good detectives,

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:58.900
it's clear what the deal is

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.890
It’s impossible for a simple boss to pull this off.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.540
Poo Seungmin, Eternal Sous Chef,

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.710
He worked there longer than me.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.070
He's the criminal.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.610
He's in cahoots with some bigwig

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.510
and tries to put all the blame on me.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.850
That's it. That's why you need to go to the police station

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.010
and say what you think about it.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.220
I was racking my brains, why bother with such a garden?

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:20.690
for me to leave

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:21.810
and here's the thing.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:24.780
This could have been done by a manager or someone higher up.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:26.920
Is it really Director Han?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.650
Why this strange monologue?

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:30.160
Time is running out.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.150
What do you think? I'm delaying the moment.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.220
We're in a hurry.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.090
What are you doing?

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:41.660
Chan Bong Hwan, stop!

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.810
Guys, you are so impatient.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.450
I'll hire a lawyer

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.750
I'll dig something up on Poo Seungmin

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.280
and I will come to you myself.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.190
You will solve the case

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.780
and you will be promoted, don’t you agree?

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.480
Let's stop. Fine?

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.550
Do you hear? Fine.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.420
Leave already.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.320
Crap.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.670
Hey!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.950
Completely crazy?

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.680
It is written - an angry dog.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.850
Don't come.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.410
Chan Bong Hwan! You're in trouble!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.050
Crap.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.550
By the way.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.100
I have an important question. Will you answer?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.260
Which?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.360
Why do they give sundae kukbap in the bullpen?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.970
What nonsense.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.600
I hate soondae gukbap.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:50.510
Is this a roadside cafe for you?

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:52.500
Decided to relax near the highway?

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.810
Are you complaining about the menu?

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:56.010
I'm a chef!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:59.020
Even in difficult times I think about food.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.140
-I'm the best chef!
- Well, you're off the hook.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.220
Hold me!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.360
Crap. I almost died.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.300
Beautiful, right?

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.790
No.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.530
There are too many women I haven't been with yet.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.680
Help. I want to live.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.320
I really want to live.

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.570
Am I in heaven?

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.540
No. I will live.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.350
What kind of rag?

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:20.350
Am I alive in the morgue?

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:27.860
No, not in the morgue.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.760
It makes sense that I won’t go to heaven.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.510
I didn't do anything wrong

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.830
but also good.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.500
What kind of old place is this?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.220
Hanok village?

00:11:56.600 --> 00:12:00.320
I fell from such a height, why doesn’t anything hurt?

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.630
Exactly. Squats can save lives.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:11.900
Am I alive, okay? My precious...

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:14.900
What? Where did the muscles go?

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:18.410
Where have my precious ones, pumped up with such difficulty, gone?

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:23.050
Crap. When you lose muscle, it turns into fat.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.880
How long was I out?

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.820
What?

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:30.920
What is this?

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.530
This is a dream.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.670
Almost died, and still women are on my mind.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:19.970
I'm fine.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:24.380
But I must be dreaming
that I am with a woman, and not instead of her.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:27.980
There's a fine line between a good night's sleep and a nightmare.

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.950
But I saw this woman somewhere.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.680
On Instagram?

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.550
No. We saw each other in person somewhere.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:40.390
Sooyoung? Chaeyoung?

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.500
Lake Ghost!

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.680
Has your voice changed too?

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:50.870
Your Highness!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.350
You've finally woken up!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.240
I knew you would wake up.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.470
Thank you.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.010
I'm so glad.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.520
-Don't move.
-What? Why?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:08.850
You're still unwell, I...

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:26.640
That's it. This is how a dream should be. How nice...

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:32.410
What is this? Terrible taste.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.010
Is it so unpleasant to drink?

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.880
Why do I feel taste in my dreams?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.320
I'll ask you to remake it and add licorice.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:46.590
Is this not a dream?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.260
What the hell is going on?

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:57.030
It's my fault.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.200
I shouldn't have left you.

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:02.350
I'm so sorry

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:05.970
that I won’t leave you for another minute.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.350
Your Highness?

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:35.870
Your Highness!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.250
Your Highness!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.750
Your Highness!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.620
Your Highness!

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.890
Oh-oh-oh, my gods!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.330
Wait, Your Highness!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.030
Your Highness!

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.130
-Your Highness!
-Lord have mercy!

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.510
-Get up.
-Where...

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:03.600
Your Highness!

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:08.970
Why are they being persecuted? It's scary.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:15.090
Your Highness! You shouldn't run like that.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.380
Where are you going, Your Highness?

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.790
Your Highness, where are you running to?

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.230
It's dangerous to run like this! Very dangerous!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:24.920
Please wait, Your Highness!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.250
Your Highness!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.220
Your Highness!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.590
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.030
Your Highness!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.530
Your Highness!

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.330
Crap!

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:39.710
Wait, Your Highness!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.410
She’s not Hong Gildong, where do she have such abilities?

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.450
Your Highness.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.720
-Your Highness!
-I beg you, don’t run!

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:45.110
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.610
Your Highness!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.680
What is this, a palace?

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:53.460
-Strange, very strange.
-Your Highness.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.020
If this is not a dream, then what is it?

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:56.430
What does this all mean?

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.160
-Stop.
-Your Highness.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.100
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.690
Your Highness!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:07.700
But what's really strange is

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:11.100
While I was running, nothing stopped me.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:14.970
No?

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:18.070
Where are my relatives?

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.510
-You shouldn't do that.
- Dear ones!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.210
Where are they?

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.250
What are you looking for?

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.920
I will personally search everything here.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:29.320
Don't come near me!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.360
It turns out

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.120
I'm impotent.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:37.670
Your Highness.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.830
You can’t run like that, you could get hurt!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:45.300
What have you done to me?

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.910
If you are concerned about your health,

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:51.010
contact the royal physician.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:54.290
I don't care who he is, just let him stick around,

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.680
I’ll make him impotent too!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.580
What the hell.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.160
Do human traffickers do this kind of thing?

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:06.690
Why would they kidnap a man and maim him like that? For what?

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.670
Who hired you?

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.260
It's idiot Poo Seungmin
So did you take your anger out on me?

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:14.860
What?

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:17.570
Or maybe Director Han?

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.050
Is that why you operated on me?

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.550
What should I order you to do?

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:25.370
Can you easily change a person’s gender?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:38.490
But why are you all dressed like that?

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.290
It's like I took a time jump.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:54.400
What?

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:06.550
What year were you born?

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:09.850
I was born on May 31, 1988 under the sign of Gemini.

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.860
Where do you live?

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:15.900
Seoul, Jongno-gu, Sambongro 31

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.560
Sojeong Parkville, apartment 302.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:21.060
What are your parents' names?

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.510
Father's name is Chang Giryong, mother's name is Lee Sujin.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.210
One teaches Chinese and the other teaches Korean history.

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.240
They are dedicated teachers

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:28.170
and I am their crazy, idiotic and only son.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.870
What? Anything else you want to know?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:54.900
Can you tickle me?

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:58.800
Like this?

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.870
So this is not a dream.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.640
Everything is too real.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.450
Then the only explanation is my soul

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.810
went back in time and inhabited this body.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.780
I can wake up.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.220
And my soul will leave this body.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.060
Listen.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.890
Tell me everything you know about this woman.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.760
This woman?

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:27.760
I'm talking about myself. Tell me what happened to me.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.240
It's all my fault.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:31.970
I didn't know you left without me.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.740
I deserve to die, Your Highness.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:37.920
I would kill you if it were

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.510
would solve my problem.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:41.710
But it won't work that way.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.180
Calm down.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.650
Don't cry. Like this.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:50.490
When and where did I go alone?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.460
Well,

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.700
2 nights ago you said you were tired

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.990
and therefore asked me to prepare the room for bed early.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.630
And I definitely checked that you were sleeping,

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.670
before returning to work.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:17.090
Why should we patrol?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.680
Our status is too high for this.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.960
You've only been working at the palace for two years.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.520
Do you have such a high status?

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.360
You are His Majesty's elder brother.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.090
And I am His Majesty's best friend.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:28.590
This is our status.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.460
Speak like one of the ministers.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.800
Oh, exactly. Have you heard?

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.730
About a girl or a ghost?

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:38.630
Every time you whisper and get so worried,

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:40.270
talk about one of them.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:42.240
I'm talking about the ghost of a virgin.

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:43.740
About both, that is.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.680
About the spirit of water from that lake.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:04.540
They jumped into the water and saved you.

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:06.870
The doctor checked my pulse and said everything was fine.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:08.040
But what's strange is

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:12.330
You haven’t woken up all day.

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.000
And then you just woke up?

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:18.740
Exactly, water.

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.990
She and I both fell into the water.

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:22.740
And there our souls became entangled.

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:26.250
Take me to the lake.

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:35.860
I told you not to follow me.

00:22:36.430 --> 00:22:38.500
I just can't remember

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.140
how she fell into the water.

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:41.300
Frets?

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:44.970
You damn henchmen.

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:47.640
They won't let you jump into the water.

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:51.250
Are we going the right way?

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.380
This is one palace. Why is it so far away?

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:55.810
We're almost there, Your Highness.

00:22:56.550 --> 00:22:59.810
The lake you fell into is behind that stone.

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:02.380
Ambush!

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:04.850
Your Highness!

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:08.790
Your Highness!

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:10.330
Your Highness!

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:13.030
Your Highness, don't do this!

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:15.240
Your Highness!

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.230
Stop!

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.470
Your Highness!

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:21.770
This is dangerous, Your Highness!

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:29.440
Let's go back. Back to my life and my precious body.

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.180
I will do good deeds sometimes.

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:34.980
Please, Almighty, Buddha, Virgin Mary.

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:45.390
Your Highness!

00:23:56.750 --> 00:23:58.510
Are you really okay?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.140
Why isn't there water there?

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:04.650
Is there a drought or what?

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:06.830
So that this doesn't happen again,

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:08.780
The water has been drained, Your Highness!

00:24:09.060 --> 00:24:11.190
And you were in no hurry to tell me.

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:13.370
I apologize, Your Highness.

00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:14.830
Your Highness!

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:16.900
Crap. It's fucking "Your Highness."

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:18.730
I'm just going to be sick right now.

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:20.960
Why are you calling me that?

00:24:22.110 --> 00:24:24.940
Her Destined Highness is not feeling very well.

00:24:24.940 --> 00:24:27.000
Address her as madam.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:28.340
Yes.

00:24:29.980 --> 00:24:32.040
"Destined Highness"? What are you talking about?

00:24:33.450 --> 00:24:36.080
You were chosen before your wedding.

00:24:36.220 --> 00:24:38.350
That is why you are called Destined Highness.

00:24:39.890 --> 00:24:41.120
"Chosen"?

00:24:43.190 --> 00:24:44.300
Then that means...

00:24:44.300 --> 00:24:47.090
You will become queen.

00:24:49.530 --> 00:24:53.700
So you are now saying,
that I will be the king's wife?

00:24:54.610 --> 00:24:55.760
Yes.

00:24:57.840 --> 00:25:01.540
Yes, I’m going crazy now, seriously!

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:03.680
Forgive us

00:25:03.680 --> 00:25:05.270
madam.

00:25:39.080 --> 00:25:41.190
How can you be so beautiful?

00:25:41.190 --> 00:25:42.520
So handsome.

00:25:42.520 --> 00:25:44.460
And what graceful fingers.

00:25:44.460 --> 00:25:46.410
Oh, mommies.

00:26:13.990 --> 00:26:15.180
Your Majesty.

00:26:15.420 --> 00:26:17.960
2 hours have already passed.

00:26:17.960 --> 00:26:19.680
I'm worried about your health.

00:26:20.760 --> 00:26:23.180
I would advise you to finish for today.

00:26:23.500 --> 00:26:24.620
Chief Eunuch.

00:26:25.500 --> 00:26:27.890
For the king in charge of the country,

00:26:28.030 --> 00:26:31.530
the desire to produce an heir should be a priority.

00:26:32.100 --> 00:26:34.940
I am extremely tired, this task is very tiring for me.

00:26:34.940 --> 00:26:37.370
I can't stop studying.

00:26:45.550 --> 00:26:47.980
Okay, the option that I travel in time is nothing like that.

00:26:48.250 --> 00:26:49.510
But why woman?

00:26:49.750 --> 00:26:52.350
And not just any kind, but just about the queen?

00:26:53.290 --> 00:26:54.960
I don't believe in marriages.

00:26:54.960 --> 00:26:56.480
Why should I be the king's wife?

00:26:57.030 --> 00:26:58.150
Come on now.

00:26:59.030 --> 00:27:02.020
If I become queen, does that mean I come from a noble family?

00:27:03.430 --> 00:27:06.160
Would you like to take a bath, madam?

00:27:10.210 --> 00:27:12.770
Call me Your Highness. Call all day.

00:27:14.010 --> 00:27:15.700
Your Highness.

00:27:16.410 --> 00:27:18.510
I'm the queen. Also?

00:27:18.920 --> 00:27:20.920
Yes, Your Highness.

00:27:20.920 --> 00:27:22.580
So, I command you.

00:27:23.120 --> 00:27:25.450
It was so infuriating, but now it’s like music in my ears.

00:27:26.760 --> 00:27:27.980
Listen.

00:27:28.530 --> 00:27:31.030
Now fill the lake with water.

00:27:31.030 --> 00:27:32.220
This is an order.

00:27:34.330 --> 00:27:36.320
Lightweight, what didn’t you think of right away?

00:27:38.300 --> 00:27:40.290
We can't, Your Highness.

00:27:41.770 --> 00:27:42.930
What?

00:27:44.480 --> 00:27:48.300
You will come to your senses when I show you my power.

00:27:57.220 --> 00:27:58.810
Have mercy, Your Highness.

00:27:59.670 --> 00:28:01.080
I deserve to die.

00:28:01.080 --> 00:28:03.500
But no matter. Please have mercy!

00:28:06.410 --> 00:28:08.910
A? What kind of reaction?

00:28:10.540 --> 00:28:12.560
Finally came to my senses.

00:28:14.310 --> 00:28:17.080
Since he torments the ladies of the court like this,

00:28:17.080 --> 00:28:19.370
obviously she is completely healthy.

00:28:21.140 --> 00:28:22.440
Bring her.

00:28:23.140 --> 00:28:24.440
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:28:32.650 --> 00:28:36.350
His Majesty wishes to see you in his gazebo.

00:28:38.330 --> 00:28:40.690
Your Majesty.

00:28:43.040 --> 00:28:44.160
Majesty?

00:28:47.900 --> 00:28:50.900
Yep, local boss.

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:22.530
Well, as you would expect, energy to hell.

00:29:24.780 --> 00:29:26.440
Your Majesty, you won't believe it.

00:29:30.610 --> 00:29:32.540
What in the name of the world happened to you?

00:29:33.410 --> 00:29:36.350
- Yes, it’s a mere trifle.
-A small change?

00:29:36.360 --> 00:29:40.380
You must look neat
and behave according to your status.

00:29:40.380 --> 00:29:42.720
Yes, I understood
just listen, this is important.

00:29:42.720 --> 00:29:44.060
Scientist

00:29:44.360 --> 00:29:47.500
in the morning I must wake up with the first roosters,

00:29:47.500 --> 00:29:50.530
look neat and not love...

00:29:53.130 --> 00:29:54.670
Don't forget about...

00:29:55.040 --> 00:29:57.970
Do not forget about your conscience, always be good-natured!

00:29:58.870 --> 00:30:01.970
Then we'll talk about philosophy.
Something important happened.

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:05.210
I urgently need water.

00:30:05.210 --> 00:30:08.650
Eunuch, bring water to the future queen now.

00:30:08.650 --> 00:30:11.180
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:30:11.180 --> 00:30:12.850
I need a lake!

00:30:13.800 --> 00:30:15.420
There is no water left in the lakes.

00:30:15.800 --> 00:30:17.620
Do you want

00:30:17.620 --> 00:30:20.220
so I can fill the lake with water?

00:30:21.570 --> 00:30:23.160
Right!

00:30:23.190 --> 00:30:24.360
I can't.

00:30:25.270 --> 00:30:29.100
-Why?
-This is an order from the Queen Dowager.

00:30:29.130 --> 00:30:32.870
I'll fill the lake with water -
I will go against her orders.

00:30:33.640 --> 00:30:35.010
Well, which one of you is king?

00:30:36.520 --> 00:30:39.140
What kind of king are you?
Can’t even fill a lake?

00:30:43.380 --> 00:30:45.480
I must listen to the Queen Dowager

00:30:45.490 --> 00:30:49.020
she is very worried about what happened.

00:30:49.330 --> 00:30:52.520
Besides, I agree with the decision to drain the lake.

00:30:55.360 --> 00:30:56.660
And what's good about that?

00:30:57.270 --> 00:30:58.800
Explain it to me properly.

00:31:02.470 --> 00:31:03.540
Just.

00:31:03.540 --> 00:31:05.170
Are you kidding me?

00:31:12.250 --> 00:31:14.150
How dare you raise your hand against me?

00:31:14.150 --> 00:31:16.820
You seem to have decided that you are a respectable scientist.

00:31:16.820 --> 00:31:19.330
But is it possible to hold your nose when sitting in front of someone?

00:31:19.330 --> 00:31:20.820
Isn't this the height of indecency?

00:31:26.890 --> 00:31:29.130
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:31:29.430 --> 00:31:31.130
I was very worried.

00:31:31.430 --> 00:31:34.570
Yeah, he carries sincerity a mile away.

00:31:35.200 --> 00:31:37.700
Have you always talked like this?

00:31:38.750 --> 00:31:41.110
I almost died
I'm just filled with rage.

00:31:41.550 --> 00:31:43.870
How did you even fall into the lake?

00:31:44.350 --> 00:31:49.180
The future queen does not remember this.

00:31:50.620 --> 00:31:52.080
Don't remember?

00:31:52.450 --> 00:31:53.780
It's strange how.

00:31:54.620 --> 00:31:56.950
So you read the “Septateuch”!

00:31:56.950 --> 00:31:59.220
I love this collection!

00:32:01.740 --> 00:32:05.330
I hate it when people touch my books.

00:32:07.370 --> 00:32:09.700
How so?
I touched your book.

00:32:11.170 --> 00:32:13.350
She's already dirty anyway.
Let me see.

00:32:13.350 --> 00:32:17.440
Stop it!
The wife must obey the man.

00:32:18.520 --> 00:32:20.110
She must obey her husband.

00:32:20.650 --> 00:32:21.910
That's what I said.

00:32:21.910 --> 00:32:23.950
-You said "man."
-Stop it!

00:32:23.950 --> 00:32:25.920
Yin does not oppose yang,

00:32:25.920 --> 00:32:29.220
and the wife submits to her husband!

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:31.790
Are we living in Joseon?

00:32:31.860 --> 00:32:33.190
In Joseon.

00:32:33.530 --> 00:32:35.390
And you, I suppose, imagine yourself to be a king.

00:32:36.040 --> 00:32:37.960
I am the king.

00:32:40.630 --> 00:32:41.770
Ancestors, help her.

00:32:45.440 --> 00:32:47.200
Disgusting woman.

00:32:50.880 --> 00:32:52.080
Let me in.

00:32:55.090 --> 00:32:56.280
Let go.

00:32:57.490 --> 00:33:00.420
Let go of the book, what are you doing?

00:33:00.590 --> 00:33:02.720
Something is fishy here.

00:33:04.830 --> 00:33:06.160
Your Majesty!

00:33:08.600 --> 00:33:11.460
It's time to receive officials.

00:33:11.810 --> 00:33:14.200
Is it time yet?

00:33:14.670 --> 00:33:17.470
The day of the king who rules the country,

00:33:17.470 --> 00:33:19.640
stretches like an endless strip...

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:22.840
Okay, you're busy! I'll go.

00:33:49.670 --> 00:33:52.040
Eunuch!

00:33:52.050 --> 00:33:53.940
I obey!

00:34:18.030 --> 00:34:19.360
eunuch,

00:34:19.700 --> 00:34:22.670
you know how much I treasured this collection.

00:34:25.010 --> 00:34:26.780
As I got older, I became slower.

00:34:26.780 --> 00:34:29.170
My hand slipped, sir.

00:34:29.240 --> 00:34:32.740
This book is worth
like three of your monthly salaries.

00:34:33.220 --> 00:34:35.180
I deserve to die!

00:34:39.550 --> 00:34:41.620
No, you won't die.

00:34:41.950 --> 00:34:44.200
No matter how expensive this book is,

00:34:44.200 --> 00:34:46.860
human life is much more valuable.

00:34:47.070 --> 00:34:50.660
Your grace is limitless, Your Majesty.

00:34:53.030 --> 00:34:56.600
You strive for knowledge
with the same zeal as me.

00:34:56.910 --> 00:35:00.400
I will prepare new books for you.

00:35:01.010 --> 00:35:03.210
But now I have a meeting with officials.

00:35:07.760 --> 00:35:09.010
Servants,

00:35:10.090 --> 00:35:11.750
prepare my palanquin.

00:35:15.220 --> 00:35:17.890
Give me a lift.
The places here are full.

00:35:20.200 --> 00:35:22.990
I don’t want to, it will be crowded together.

00:35:23.740 --> 00:35:26.560
And finally wash yourself.

00:35:29.410 --> 00:35:30.770
Forward.

00:35:38.340 --> 00:35:41.250
What?
What a clever worm.

00:35:54.340 --> 00:35:57.130
Your Highness, don't sit on the ground!

00:35:57.160 --> 00:35:59.260
How my back hurts.

00:36:10.470 --> 00:36:12.310
Lost your memory?

00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:21.250
I'm sure everything is not so simple.

00:36:21.990 --> 00:36:25.030
Before an important event, the illness worsened.

00:36:25.030 --> 00:36:26.660
She convinced herself that she -
another person

00:36:26.660 --> 00:36:29.030
to escape the truth.

00:36:53.860 --> 00:36:58.460
Only I and the Queen Dowager heard it.

00:36:58.930 --> 00:37:02.760
If anyone mentions what they heard...

00:37:05.610 --> 00:37:08.770
This will never happen.

00:37:10.680 --> 00:37:14.170
Find a way to cure Her Highness.

00:37:14.840 --> 00:37:16.040
Necessarily.

00:37:41.530 --> 00:37:46.940
How can we make a girl queen
that he doesn’t know his own name?

00:37:47.470 --> 00:37:51.340
We can tell her what her name is
help bring back memories.

00:37:51.340 --> 00:37:53.040
Don't worry.

00:37:53.990 --> 00:37:55.750
Do you want to meet her?

00:37:56.220 --> 00:37:57.590
Many eyes are directed at us.

00:37:57.590 --> 00:37:59.660
No need to give people reasons

00:37:59.660 --> 00:38:01.530
discuss the fact that she doesn’t recognize her own family.

00:38:01.530 --> 00:38:04.690
Very few people will know about this.

00:38:05.970 --> 00:38:08.990
This is what worries me

00:38:08.990 --> 00:38:11.560
Why did she wander alone at night?

00:38:11.660 --> 00:38:12.960
Someone

00:38:14.070 --> 00:38:17.500
deceived her by conveying a fake order from the king.

00:38:18.410 --> 00:38:21.040
Therefore, it will be difficult to find out anything.

00:38:21.950 --> 00:38:23.610
But who dared?

00:38:31.890 --> 00:38:32.980
Did she wake up?

00:38:37.970 --> 00:38:39.060
Is it true?

00:38:43.090 --> 00:38:45.130
I'm sure the talisman worked.

00:38:46.260 --> 00:38:48.070
And this shaman is good.

00:38:52.410 --> 00:38:55.410
If something happens
report to me.

00:38:57.220 --> 00:38:59.980
Rumors are circulating around the palace

00:39:00.240 --> 00:39:01.990
like a girl chosen

00:39:01.990 --> 00:39:04.310
for the role of a concubine,
pushed the king's bride into the lake.

00:39:04.490 --> 00:39:06.880
She will not become a royal concubine.

00:39:08.160 --> 00:39:09.930
What's her name? What about Hwajin?

00:39:09.930 --> 00:39:11.050
Right.

00:39:12.930 --> 00:39:15.030
I needed a reason, here it is.

00:39:15.340 --> 00:39:17.640
Moreover, her family is in decline.

00:39:17.640 --> 00:39:19.400
Even with smoldering coals

00:39:20.300 --> 00:39:22.930
you should be extremely careful.

00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:25.940
Regarding the change in the law on civil service,

00:39:26.110 --> 00:39:29.320
conservative and progressive parties
could not reach a consensus.

00:39:29.320 --> 00:39:31.780
Resolve our dispute, sir.

00:39:32.410 --> 00:39:33.710
I believe

00:39:35.360 --> 00:39:37.380
that the progressive party

00:39:38.530 --> 00:39:40.650
no, conservative...

00:39:41.760 --> 00:39:45.520
What should I do?

00:39:52.110 --> 00:39:53.530
Progressive Party

00:39:53.530 --> 00:39:55.640
demands the repeal of this law,

00:39:55.640 --> 00:39:58.010
but then we will face serious economic damage.

00:39:58.010 --> 00:39:59.200
My advice -

00:39:59.200 --> 00:40:01.770
This is a gradual repeal of the law.

00:40:02.470 --> 00:40:05.340
They took it right off the tongue!

00:40:08.620 --> 00:40:10.780
Next on the agenda

00:40:10.780 --> 00:40:12.480
royal marriage theme.

00:40:13.260 --> 00:40:15.020
I don't know if you heard

00:40:15.360 --> 00:40:17.790
but my bride finally woke up.

00:40:18.260 --> 00:40:19.370
Your Majesty,

00:40:19.370 --> 00:40:21.740
There are terrible rumors circulating around the palace,

00:40:21.740 --> 00:40:25.500
as if your fiancee has lost her mind.

00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:28.330
Seriously?

00:40:28.970 --> 00:40:31.130
This is the first time I've heard of something like this.

00:40:31.970 --> 00:40:33.910
And the fact that she woke up,

00:40:33.910 --> 00:40:35.770
I found out because we met.

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:39.710
Am I the last to hear all the news?

00:40:40.120 --> 00:40:42.650
These are just rumors.

00:40:43.050 --> 00:40:46.180
We didn't mean to worry you

00:40:46.180 --> 00:40:49.190
so they kept silent about it.

00:40:49.430 --> 00:40:50.860
How caring you are.

00:40:50.860 --> 00:40:52.120
I'm sure of these rumors

00:40:52.930 --> 00:40:55.460
there is a grain of truth.

00:40:58.110 --> 00:40:59.410
When we saw each other

00:40:59.410 --> 00:41:01.600
she actually acted a little differently.

00:41:03.280 --> 00:41:05.870
She said that she did not remember how she fell into the lake.

00:41:06.300 --> 00:41:09.210
The virgin lost her memories from shock!

00:41:09.640 --> 00:41:11.450
This means something terrible happened.

00:41:11.450 --> 00:41:12.510
Scary?

00:41:12.510 --> 00:41:14.950
I don't believe her fall

00:41:14.950 --> 00:41:17.050
was an accident.

00:41:18.050 --> 00:41:19.160
What?

00:41:19.160 --> 00:41:20.320
Shortly before this

00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:22.390
a eunuch passing near the lake,

00:41:22.390 --> 00:41:24.890
I saw a strange woman.

00:41:24.890 --> 00:41:26.360
-A strange woman?
-Whom?

00:41:37.640 --> 00:41:39.300
And who was it?

00:41:40.010 --> 00:41:42.070
According to palace records,

00:41:42.070 --> 00:41:45.410
only one woman entered the palace at that time.

00:41:46.320 --> 00:41:48.350
Cho Daesu's daughter

00:41:48.590 --> 00:41:50.150
Cho Hwajin.

00:41:53.550 --> 00:41:55.790
How dare you suspect her?

00:41:56.160 --> 00:42:00.160
