01:00:20.810 --> 01:00:23.310
Filling a lake or pond will be a piece of cake?

01:00:45.800 --> 01:00:48.640
Your Highness, are you awake yet?

01:01:22.710 --> 01:01:23.870
Come in.

01:01:40.260 --> 01:01:41.720
Do I need to wear all this?

01:01:43.230 --> 01:01:45.660
Queen's formal robes

01:01:45.660 --> 01:01:47.260
Underwear, long johns,

01:01:47.260 --> 01:01:49.170
loose pants, petticoat,

01:01:49.170 --> 01:01:51.030
outerwear, undershirt,

01:01:51.030 --> 01:01:53.000
first skirt, second skirt,

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:55.140
third skirt, jacket with colored piping

01:01:55.140 --> 01:01:57.640
and an outer jacket.

01:01:58.510 --> 01:02:01.040
Clothing at the top is narrow cut and fits close to the body,

01:02:01.040 --> 01:02:03.110
at the bottom, on the contrary, it is wide.

01:02:03.110 --> 01:02:05.950
This creates the illusion of a lady’s ideal curvaceous figure.

01:02:05.950 --> 01:02:08.750
Small up, big down

01:02:11.590 --> 01:02:13.060
I can't breathe.

01:02:43.050 --> 01:02:44.850
Jade beads cover your eyes,

01:02:45.090 --> 01:02:48.090
and sapphire ears.

01:02:48.190 --> 01:02:50.330
A sign that the king should

01:02:50.330 --> 01:02:52.590
close your eyes and ears and listen to your yard.

01:02:58.000 --> 01:02:59.370
Straighten your neck.

01:02:59.600 --> 01:03:00.900
She's heavy.

01:03:00.900 --> 01:03:03.540
You must bear this heavy burden.

01:03:54.490 --> 01:03:57.390
I am the first woman in Joseon without a bra.

01:04:01.160 --> 01:04:03.670
Mutual bow.

01:04:08.400 --> 01:04:10.610
-Your Highness.
-What do you want?

01:04:47.810 --> 01:04:50.110
We are not commemorating our ancestors here.

01:04:50.110 --> 01:04:52.550
A wedding is like a funeral.

01:04:57.120 --> 01:04:58.650
How many times should you bow?

01:04:58.650 --> 01:05:00.120
2 more.

01:05:10.100 --> 01:05:12.970
What a beautiful couple they made.

01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:17.570
All with your efforts and prayers, Your Majesty.

01:05:17.570 --> 01:05:20.140
I'm glad you noticed this, Your Majesty.

01:05:25.150 --> 01:05:27.920
Raise the bowls.

01:05:59.680 --> 01:06:01.680
My brother,

01:06:02.150 --> 01:06:04.120
why are you crying?

01:06:07.320 --> 01:06:10.190
I am happy that my daughter became the queen of this country,

01:06:11.430 --> 01:06:12.690
but still -

01:06:13.160 --> 01:06:16.300
I feel like I have lost my only child.

01:06:17.430 --> 01:06:18.930
Okay for you.

01:06:19.640 --> 01:06:22.400
You are now the queen's father.

01:06:22.940 --> 01:06:25.570
His Highness Yonggeun.

01:06:25.670 --> 01:06:26.880
Is it true?

01:06:27.840 --> 01:06:29.140
Right.

01:06:35.680 --> 01:06:38.790
Soyeon from the Andong Kim family

01:06:38.950 --> 01:06:41.860
became the queen of Joseon.

01:06:42.360 --> 01:06:44.530
This is the first time I've heard this woman's name.

01:06:44.530 --> 01:06:46.600
You must love me.

01:07:05.310 --> 01:07:07.820
I can't, I can't breathe.

01:07:08.450 --> 01:07:09.790
Heart attack?

01:07:33.180 --> 01:07:35.140
Show respect!

01:07:35.510 --> 01:07:40.180
Long life to the king and queen!

01:07:44.850 --> 01:07:49.360
There are no enemies or allies in the palace.

01:07:49.530 --> 01:07:53.600
Don't lose your balance and don't let your heart cloud your mind.

01:07:53.860 --> 01:07:55.660
Don't worry.

01:07:55.660 --> 01:07:57.100
I'm heading to the palace

01:07:57.100 --> 01:07:59.640
because I want to be useful to His Majesty.

01:07:59.700 --> 01:08:01.000
God.

01:08:05.240 --> 01:08:08.440
Nurse, I will not die.

01:08:08.440 --> 01:08:10.110
Don't cry for me.

01:08:11.610 --> 01:08:13.950
Young lady, you are too kind.

01:08:14.350 --> 01:08:18.020
I don't know if you can survive in the palace.

01:08:18.690 --> 01:08:22.060
Don't worry. I will serve my lady faithfully.

01:09:31.060 --> 01:09:33.360
I give up! I give up!

01:09:38.270 --> 01:09:40.500
I thought we would read poems in the gazebo.

01:09:40.570 --> 01:09:43.640
Couldn't warn you
that this is training and not rest?

01:09:43.810 --> 01:09:45.070
Aren't you resting?

01:09:45.070 --> 01:09:47.010
Sweat in a place with a view like this.

01:09:47.010 --> 01:09:48.280
Resting?

01:09:48.280 --> 01:09:50.650
Because of the father of the Minister of War, it’s already necessary

01:09:50.650 --> 01:09:53.320
train every day - and I don’t even like military affairs.

01:09:53.320 --> 01:09:55.120
What are we even doing here?

01:09:55.220 --> 01:09:57.650
If I had known, I would never have gone with you.

01:10:00.390 --> 01:10:02.990
You might think you are preparing to fight the enemy.

01:10:03.030 --> 01:10:05.160
Why were you upset by such good news?

01:10:05.160 --> 01:10:06.530
Your cousin has become queen.

01:10:09.630 --> 01:10:12.130
I have a full hanbok of happiness - I don’t know what to do with it.

01:10:13.470 --> 01:10:16.510
If you don't like sword fighting, maybe we can fight hand-to-hand?

01:10:17.640 --> 01:10:20.110
I changed my mind. I'll go home.

01:10:24.050 --> 01:10:25.610
You will go when you defeat me.

01:10:29.920 --> 01:10:32.650
Faster, faster. She dug into my neck.

01:10:34.360 --> 01:10:36.360
I almost died there.

01:10:36.890 --> 01:10:39.590
Photo sessions with a stylist -
garbage compared to this.

01:10:53.210 --> 01:10:55.980
We got a room upgrade.

01:10:56.140 --> 01:10:57.680
This is Daejojeon Hall.

01:10:58.650 --> 01:11:01.220
The name matches the place.

01:11:01.380 --> 01:11:04.490
It means you have a lot to contribute.

01:11:04.850 --> 01:11:07.190
Do you want me to save the country or what?

01:11:07.560 --> 01:11:08.760
You have to give birth

01:11:09.620 --> 01:11:11.760
the king's heirs.

01:11:17.600 --> 01:11:19.800
Exactly. It's also the wedding night.

01:11:21.700 --> 01:11:24.940
The biggest hit in all 33 years of Jang Bong-hwan's life.

01:11:39.890 --> 01:11:42.690
There must be a way out of any situation.

01:11:45.790 --> 01:11:47.900
There must be.

01:11:48.200 --> 01:11:50.230
The drinks have arrived.

01:12:02.410 --> 01:12:04.650
That's right, alcohol.

01:12:06.520 --> 01:12:08.880
But the ancestors knew what they were doing.

01:12:35.110 --> 01:12:36.750
Let me pour it for you.

01:12:37.410 --> 01:12:40.980
What does His Majesty want to drink?

01:12:41.320 --> 01:12:43.620
I like snacks more than alcohol itself.

01:12:44.020 --> 01:12:45.220
What are you...

01:12:45.590 --> 01:12:49.690
Today is a special day.
Don't eat too much and drink better.

01:12:50.330 --> 01:12:52.790
Excessive consumption of wine is harmful to the body.

01:12:53.300 --> 01:12:54.600
Oh you little one...

01:12:55.800 --> 01:12:57.730
Calm, just calm.

01:12:57.970 --> 01:13:01.270
There is no Korean who would not be proud of
how much he can use.

01:13:01.940 --> 01:13:04.940
It's clear. So you don't know how to drink.

01:13:04.940 --> 01:13:07.340
It’s immediately obvious that you won’t drink me again.

01:13:07.580 --> 01:13:08.780
And good.

01:13:08.780 --> 01:13:11.210
All alcohol is in your favor.

01:13:11.950 --> 01:13:14.650
Is he bulletproof, or what?

01:13:15.020 --> 01:13:17.150
It doesn't lead to anything.

01:13:17.150 --> 01:13:19.320
Fine. Do you want to play a game?

01:13:19.890 --> 01:13:22.520
I know a couple of games where you have to drink.

01:13:23.360 --> 01:13:24.530
Is it true?

01:13:24.930 --> 01:13:26.930
3, 6, 9, 3, 6, 9,

01:13:26.930 --> 01:13:28.760
3, 6, 9, 3, 6, 9.

01:13:31.730 --> 01:13:33.740
When did multiplication tables appear in Korea?

01:13:33.740 --> 01:13:36.040
Don't know? Then -

01:13:36.040 --> 01:13:39.310
magpie-crow, magpie-crow, magpie-crow,

01:13:39.310 --> 01:13:41.880
magpie-crow, magpie-crow.

01:13:41.880 --> 01:13:44.880
It seems that the word “shame” was invented for this occasion.

01:13:44.880 --> 01:13:46.180
Hey, what aren't you doing?

01:13:46.380 --> 01:13:47.680
What should you do?

01:13:48.050 --> 01:13:50.150
I liked the idea of playing

01:13:50.550 --> 01:13:53.660
but you just shout "magpie-crow". Boring.

01:13:54.360 --> 01:13:55.920
Here's a nitpick.

01:13:57.230 --> 01:14:00.160
Alcohol needs dancing and music.

01:14:04.070 --> 01:14:07.500
How long can you dance to the ancient music of your ancestors?

01:14:07.500 --> 01:14:08.670
Watch your shoulders.

01:14:08.670 --> 01:14:10.340
They go up and down.

01:14:10.340 --> 01:14:11.670
And the glass goes down,

01:14:11.670 --> 01:14:13.980
down, down, down.

01:14:13.980 --> 01:14:15.180
The little charm is going down

01:14:15.180 --> 01:14:16.180
down, down, down.

01:14:16.180 --> 01:14:17.650
Are you that excited?

01:14:22.180 --> 01:14:25.120
Did the ancestral music work?

01:14:29.560 --> 01:14:30.990
Shall we get started then?

01:14:40.070 --> 01:14:42.400
No, that's not what I meant!

01:14:54.580 --> 01:14:56.950
We'll have to take the extreme step.

01:15:39.390 --> 01:15:42.200
What is it like to greet a new day as a queen?

01:15:42.200 --> 01:15:43.370
- It's crap.
- That's it.

01:15:43.370 --> 01:15:46.370
We are preparing for a battle for power and retribution.

01:15:46.370 --> 01:15:49.440
The only way to punish those in power is

01:15:49.440 --> 01:15:52.170
find evidence of their bribery and bad conscience.

01:15:52.170 --> 01:15:53.540
Having seen her in person,

01:15:53.540 --> 01:15:56.240
I see that the queen is still not herself.

01:15:56.240 --> 01:15:58.510
It's more important to us who she should be,

01:15:58.510 --> 01:16:01.350
than who she is.

01:16:01.520 --> 01:16:02.520
This is a gift.

01:16:02.520 --> 01:16:04.250
If there is a good way, use it.

01:16:04.250 --> 01:16:06.020
What last resort are you talking about?

01:16:06.090 --> 01:16:07.260
Murder.
